(396, '_transient_novamira_update_info', 'a:13:{s:4:\"name\";s:8:\"Novamira\";s:7:\"version\";s:7:\"1.12.15\";s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Dynamic.ooo\";s:15:\"author_homepage\";s:24:\"https://www.dynamic.ooo/\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:19:\"https://novamira.ai\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.9\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"8.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:5:\"7.1.4\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2026-11-06 22:04:58\";s:8:\"sections\";a:2:{s:9:\"changelog\";s:1318:\"v1.12.15 - 2026/11/06<br />* New: Gemini Desktop support. Connect Gemini Desktop to your site with OAuth sign-in through its custom connector.<br />* Fix: Faster responses to AI clients on some hosting.<br />* Fix: A NOVAMIRA_WP_CLI_COMMAND constant pointing at a missing or non-executable program, or at a missing phar, now reports WP-CLI as unavailable and names the constant and the path, where the WP-CLI abilities were previously listed and then failed with \"Failed to start process.\"<br />* Fix: Sites using the custom login URL of SureMembers, or another plugin that checks the previous page whenever WordPress builds a site address, no longer crash with memory errors on pages reached from a link.<br />* Fix: Troubleshoot no longer asks to add the .well-known rule again when it is already in place. On hosting with a known firewall, such as SiteGround or Cloudflare, a 403 on the OAuth discovery URLs now points to hosting support, unless the .well-known rule is missing or the site itself produced the error.<br />* Fix: On sites with a page cache plugin such as WP-Optimize, AI clients can now connect with OAuth, where the plugin\'s note added to the sign-in details made them unreadable.<br />* Minor Fixes<br /><br /><br />For full list of changelog <a href=\"https://novamira.ai/changelog\">click here</a>\";s:11:\"description\";s:470:\"Novamira turns your WordPress site into a programmable environment for AI. Your AI client connects to your site directly over the Model Context Protocol and works with real PHP, the database, files, themes, and plugins, the same building blocks you would use yourself. The plugin runs on your own server, so the connection is direct: no proxy, and no data passing through our servers. Your AI, your WordPress. Nothing in between. Built for development and staging sites.\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:2:{s:2:\"1x\";s:60:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/icon-128x128.png\";s:2:\"2x\";s:60:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/icon-256x256.png\";}s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:4:\"high\";s:63:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/banner-1544x500.png\";s:3:\"low\";s:62:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/banner-772x250.png\";}s:12:\"download_url\";s:88:\"https://nbg1.your-objectstorage.com/ooo-zips-free/novamira/versions/novamira-1.12.15.zip\";}', 'off'),
